This endpoint makes an HTTP GET request to retrieve a list of books. The response of this request is documented below as a JSON schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "books": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "author": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "genre": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "publishedDate": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          }
        },
        "required": ["title", "author", "genre", "publishedDate"]
      }
    }
  }
}

 ```

