request.description:
### Get Books by Publisher

This endpoint retrieves a list of books based on the publisher's name.

#### Request

- Method: GET
- Endpoint: `{{baseDomain}}{{versionApi}}books/search`
- Query Parameters:
  - `publisher` (string, required): The name of the publisher for which books are to be searched.

#### Response

The response for this request is a JSON object with the following properties:
- `books` (array): An array of book objects matching the search criteria.
  - `title` (string): The title of the book.
  - `author` (string): The author of the book.
  - `isbn` (string): The ISBN of the book.
  - `publishedDate` (string): The published date of the book.
  - `publisher` (string): The name of the publisher of the book.

#### JSON Schema

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "books": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": { "type": "string" },
          "author": { "type": "string" },
          "isbn": { "type": "string" },
          "publishedDate": { "type": "string" },
          "publisher": { "type": "string" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

